    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60661" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κυκλώπ-ειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span> (in <i><span class="en">
			Eust.
			1634.35
		</span></i>, al., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>), (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύκλωψ</span>)
		<u>Cyclopean</u>, used of prehistoric architecture attributed to
