			E.
			<u>El.</u>
			1158
		</span></i> (lyr.); to ancient buildings near Nauplia, <i><span class="en">
			Str.
			8.6.2
		</span></i>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. βίος</span>
